* {{dlc+|r}}{{e|Eternal Fly Bomb}}, a [[monster]] commonly found in {{s|Gehenna}}.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}}{{e|Fly Bomb}}, a [[monster]] commonly found in {{s|Mines}}.{{dlc-}}
