== Items ==
* {{i|Blood Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that increases [[health]] and leave a pool of [[red creep]] when a bomb explodes.
* {{i|Bobby-Bomb}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs and causes bombs to home in on enemies.
* {{i|BOGO Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that doubles all normal bomb pickups.
* {{i|Bomb Bag}}, a [[passive collectible]] that spawns a [[familiar]] that drops a bomb every few rooms.
* {{i|Bomber Boy}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs and causes bombs to explode in a large cross-shaped blast.
* {{i|Brimstone Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs and fires {{i|Brimstone}} lasers when a bomb explodes.
* {{i|Butt Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs and spawns a damaging and [[confusion|confusing]] cloud when a bomb explodes.
* {{i|Fast Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs and removes the delay between bomb placements.
* {{i|Ghost Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs and spawns an exploding ghost when a bomb explodes.
* {{i|Glitter Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs and a chance to charm enemies and spawn a [[pickup]] or [[trinket]] when a bomb explodes.
* {{i|Hot Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs and causes bombs to deal contact damage and leave behind a fire.
* {{i|Nancy Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs and causes bombs to gain the effects of random bomb synergies.
* {{i|Sad Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs and shoot 10 tears off in every direction when a bomb explodes.
* {{i|Scatter Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs and causes bombs to split into tiny bombs after exploding.
* {{i|Sticky Bombs}}, a [[passive collectible]] that grants bombs, causes bombs to stick to enemies, and spawns [[Blue Spider]]s when a bomb kills the enemy it has stuck to.

== Pickups ==
* [[Bomb]]s, a type of [[pickup]].
* [[Bombs Are Key]], a [[pill]] effect that swaps the values of bombs and keys.
* [[Bomb Chest]], a [[chest]] that opens when hit by an explosion.

== Environment ==
* [[Bomb Bum]], a [[beggar]] which asks for [[bomb]]s in exchange for pickups and items.
* [[Bomb Rock]], a [[rock]] that explodes when destroyed.

